&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Alpha-1 manages to restrain O5&amp;#160;1, 2, 5, 8, 9, 11, and 13, however, O5&amp;#160;3, 5, 6, 7, 10, and 12 manage to exit Conference Room Alpha into Corridor 81-B in pursuit of O5-4.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
