&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As corridor 123-G begins twisting itself into a spiral shape, the pursuing Overseers lose their lines of sight on O5-4, giving him the opportunity to get up and continue running through the now spiraling corridor.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The arms of the Overseers begin twisting into spirals.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
