&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-171722-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. The DNA of these eggs and the SCP-4174-A instances created do not match that of SCP-4174 and have included several different male individuals.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-171722-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. It has been noted by staff working with SCP-4174 that these cries are higher in pitch than what would be expected, described as &amp;quot;Sounding like a highly distressed baby.&amp;quot;&lt;/div&gt;
